 "A comment thread you edited will be saved as an ordinary note. Excel will show it as a note, not as a conversation.": "您编辑的批注对话将保存为普通备注。Excel 会将其显示为备注，而非对话。",
 "A formula or function contains invalid numeric values.": "公式或函数包含无效的数值。",
 "A free office suite that runs in your browser: a word processor, a spreadsheet and a presentation editor for .docx, .xlsx and .pptx files.": "在浏览器中运行的免费办公套件，提供文字处理器、电子表格和演示文稿编辑器，可处理 .docx、.xlsx 和 .pptx 文件。",
 "A labelled box for each item, holding its sub-items.": "每个项目各占一个带标签的方框，子项目置于其中。",
 "A list cannot overlap another list.": "列表不能与其他列表重叠。",
 "A newer version of VibeOffice is available. This one is {0}.": "VibeOffice 有新版本可用。当前版本为 {0}。",
 "A pasted slicer or timeline will be saved as a plain shape and won't filter anything, because its table or pivot table isn't in this workbook.": "粘贴的切片器或时间线将保存为普通形状，无法筛选数据，因为其所属的表或数据透视表不在此工作簿中。",
 "A picture fill on a shape of this IntelliArt is saved as the diagram's colour.": "此 IntelliArt 中形状的图片填充将保存为图示的颜色。",
 "A picture is not in the .md file and shows as a box. Open a .zip holding the file and its pictures to see them.": "图片不在 .md 文件中，因此显示为方框。请打开包含该文件及其图片的 .zip 文件以查看图片。",
 "A presentation editor that runs entirely in your browser. Presentations are read and written as Office Open XML (.pptx, .pptm); nothing is uploaded.": "完全在浏览器中运行的演示文稿编辑器。支持读写 Office Open XML（.pptx、.pptm）演示文稿；不会上传任何内容。",
 "A reference to an IntelliArt drawing cache missing from the original file was removed; its data and layout are retained.": "原文件中缺失的 IntelliArt 绘图缓存引用已移除；其数据和布局仍予以保留。",
 "A sheet name cannot begin or end with an apostrophe.": "工作表名称不能以单引号开头或结尾。",
 "A sheet name cannot contain any of these characters:  : \\\\ / ? * [ ]": "工作表名称不能包含以下字符：: \\\\ / ? * [ ]",
 "A sheet name must be 1 to 31 characters long.": "工作表名称必须为 1 到 31 个字符。",
 "A slicer or timeline you edited will be saved as a plain shape and will no longer filter data.": "您编辑的切片器或时间线将保存为普通形状，无法再筛选数据。",
 "A small table": "小型表格",
 "A source column used by the pivot table was deleted. Its remaining result cells are kept.": "数据透视表使用的源数据列已被删除。其余结果单元格予以保留。",
 "A spreadsheet that runs entirely in your browser. Workbooks are read and written as Office Open XML (.xlsx, .xlsm), CSV and text; nothing is uploaded.": "完全在浏览器中运行的电子表格应用。支持读写 Office Open XML（.xlsx、.xlsm）、CSV 和文本工作簿；不会上传任何内容。",
