 "A word processor that runs entirely in your browser. Documents are read and written as Office Open XML (.docx, .docm), RTF, HTML, text and Markdown; nothing is uploaded.": "完全在浏览器中运行的文字处理器。支持读写 Office Open XML（.docx、.docm）、RTF、HTML、文本和 Markdown 文档；不会上传任何内容。",
