 "Checking spelling and grammar as you type in this document.": "在此文档中键入时检查拼写和语法。",
 "Checks whether a condition is met, and returns one value if TRUE, and another value if FALSE.": "检查条件是否满足；若为 TRUE 则返回一个值，若为 FALSE 则返回另一个值。",
