 "Choose AutoShapes on the Drawing toolbar, then drag on the slide. Hold Shift for perfect squares, circles and 15° angles; hold Ctrl to draw from the center. Yellow diamonds adjust a shape's proportions; the green dot rotates.": "在“绘图”工具栏中选择“自选图形”，然后在幻灯片上拖动。按住 Shift 可绘制正方形、正圆或以 15° 为单位的角度；按住 Ctrl 可从中心绘制。黄色菱形用于调整形状比例，绿色圆点用于旋转。",
