 "Click to place the insertion point and type. Double-click selects a word, triple-click a paragraph; click in the left margin to select a line, double-click there for a paragraph, Ctrl+click for the whole document. Ctrl+click in text selects a sentence. F8 extends the selection step by step (word, sentence, paragraph, document); Esc stops.": "单击定位插入点并键入内容。双击选择单词，三击选择段落；在左页边距单击选择一行，双击选择段落，按住 Ctrl 单击选择整个文档。在文本中按住 Ctrl 单击可选择句子。按 F8 可逐步扩展选区（单词、句子、段落、文档），按 Esc 停止扩展。",
