 "Converts a text time to a Ledger serial number for a time, a number from 0 (12:00:00 AM) to 0.999988426 (11:59:59 PM).": "将文本形式的时间转换为 Ledger 时间序列号，范围为 0（凌晨 12:00:00）至 0.999988426（晚上 11:59:59）。",
