 "Data may exist in the sheet(s) selected for deletion. To permanently delete the data, press Delete.": "选定要删除的工作表可能包含数据。要永久删除这些数据，请按“删除”。",
 "Data preview:": "数据预览：",
 "Data source: {0}. Click a column heading to sort; clear a check box to leave a recipient out.": "数据源：{0}。单击列标题可排序；清除复选框可排除相应收件人。",
 "Data ▸ List ▸ Create List (Ctrl+L) turns a range into a list with a header row, AutoFilter and an optional Total Row. Formulas can refer to it by name: =SUM(Table1[Amount]).": "“数据 ▸ 列表 ▸ 创建列表”(Ctrl+L) 可将区域转换为包含标题行、自动筛选和可选汇总行的列表。公式可以通过名称引用列表，例如：=SUM(Table1[Amount])。",
 "Data ▸ Sort sorts by up to three keys, ascending or descending, with or without a header row; the Sort buttons sort by the active column. Data ▸ Filter ▸ AutoFilter adds drop-down arrows to the header row: pick a value, (Top 10...), (Custom...), (Blanks) or (NonBlanks). Advanced Filter uses a criteria range and can copy unique records elsewhere. Data ▸ Subtotals inserts SUBTOTAL rows at each change in a column and outlines the list.": "“数据 ▸ 排序”支持最多三个关键字，可升序或降序排列，也可指定有无标题行；排序按钮则按活动列排序。“数据 ▸ 筛选 ▸ 自动筛选”会在标题行添加下拉箭头，可选择某个值、“前 10 个...”、“自定义...”、“空白”或“非空白”。高级筛选使用条件区域，并可将不重复的记录复制到其他位置。“数据 ▸ 分类汇总”会在指定列内容变化处插入 SUBTOTAL 汇总行，并建立分级显示。",
