 "Drag a header border to resize; double-click it to AutoFit. Right-click a header to insert, delete, hide or unhide. Window ▸ Freeze Panes keeps headings in view. Right-click a sheet tab to insert, delete, rename, move or copy sheets, or to set a tab colour; Ctrl+Page Up / Page Down switch sheets.": "拖动行列标题的边框可调整大小，双击可自动调整。右键单击行列标题可插入、删除、隐藏或取消隐藏。“窗口 ▸ 冻结窗格”可让标题保持可见。右键单击工作表标签可插入、删除、重命名、移动或复制工作表，也可设置标签颜色；Ctrl+Page Up / Page Down 可切换工作表。",
 "Drag and Drop": "拖放",
 "Drag in the worksheet to insert the AutoShape. Press Esc to cancel.": "在工作表中拖动以插入自选图形。按 Esc 取消。",
 "Drag in the worksheet to insert the text box. Press Esc to cancel.": "在工作表中拖动以插入文本框。按 Esc 取消。",
 "Drag the fill handle (the square at the bottom-right of the selection) to copy cells or extend a series: 1, 2 → 3, 4…; Mon → Tue; Jan → Feb; Q1 → Q2; dates by day, weekday, month or year. Double-click the handle to fill down beside your data. Edit ▸ Fill ▸ Series gives full control; Ctrl+D and Ctrl+R fill down and right.": "拖动填充柄（选区右下角的小方块）可复制单元格或扩展序列：1、2 → 3、4…；Mon → Tue；Jan → Feb；Q1 → Q2；日期可按日、工作日、月或年递增。双击填充柄可沿相邻数据向下填充。“编辑 ▸ 填充 ▸ 序列”提供完整设置；Ctrl+D 和 Ctrl+R 分别向下和向右填充。",
 "Drag the green rotation handle to rotate. Hold Shift for 15° steps.": "拖动绿色旋转控点可旋转。按住 Shift 可按 15° 递增。",
