 "Font names are used solely to identify the fonts specified in documents and to maintain interoperability with Office Open XML files and the applications that create them; such names may be trademarks of their respective owners. VibeOffice renders text with the fonts installed on your computer. Where a specified font is not installed, VibeOffice substitutes an open-source font supplied with it or another font available on your computer, and the document may therefore appear differently than in other applications. VibeOffice does not include or distribute any commercial font software.": "字体名称仅用于识别文档中指定的字体，并保持与 Office Open XML 文件及创建这些文件的应用程序的互操作性；这些名称可能是其各自所有者的商标。VibeOffice 使用您计算机上安装的字体显示文本。如果指定的字体未安装，VibeOffice 会使用随软件提供的开源字体或您计算机上其他可用的字体进行替代，因此文档的显示效果可能与其他应用程序有所不同。VibeOffice 不包含或分发任何商业字体软件。",
