 "Insert the date / time": "插入日期/时间",
 "Insert worksheet": "插入工作表",
 "Insert ▸ Break adds page, column and section breaks. Each section can have its own margins, orientation, paper size, columns and headers. File ▸ Page Setup sets margins, paper, layout (different first page, odd and even, vertical alignment, line numbers) for the current section or the whole document.": "“插入 ▸ 分隔符”可添加分页符、分栏符和分节符。每节可设置独立的页边距、方向、纸张大小、分栏和页眉。“文件 ▸ 页面设置”可为当前节或整个文档设置页边距、纸张及版式（首页不同、奇偶页不同、垂直对齐、行号）。",
 "Insert ▸ Chart (F11) opens the Chart Wizard: column, bar, line, pie, XY scatter, area and doughnut charts, embedded in the sheet or on their own chart sheet. Charts follow their data as it changes. Insert ▸ Picture adds images and AutoShapes; drag to move, drag a handle to resize, double-click to format.": "“插入 ▸ 图表”(F11) 可打开图表向导，创建柱形图、条形图、折线图、饼图、XY 散点图、面积图和圆环图，并将其嵌入工作表或置于独立图表工作表中。图表会随数据更改而更新。“插入 ▸ 图片”可添加图片和自选图形；拖动可移动，拖动控点可调整大小，双击可设置格式。",
 "Insert ▸ Picture ▸ From File, Clip Art, AutoShapes, LettersArt or Chart. Choose a wrapping style from Format ▸ Picture ▸ Layout or the Text Wrapping button. Drag floating objects to move them; drag handles to resize; the green handle rotates shapes.": "通过“插入 ▸ 图片”选择“来自文件”、“剪贴画”、“自选图形”、“LettersArt”或“图表”。在“格式 ▸ 图片 ▸ 版式”或“文字环绕”按钮中选择环绕方式。拖动浮动对象可移动，拖动控点可调整大小，绿色控点可旋转形状。",
 "Insert ▸ Reference": "插入 ▸ 引用",
 "Insert ▸ Reference ▸ Footnote (Ctrl+Alt+F footnote, Ctrl+Alt+D endnote), Caption, Cross-reference and Index and Tables (table of contents, figures, index). Right-click a field and choose Update Field, or press F9. Alt+F9 shows field codes.": "“插入 ▸ 引用”提供“脚注”（Ctrl+Alt+F 为脚注，Ctrl+Alt+D 为尾注）、“题注”、“交叉引用”和“索引和目录”（目录、图表目录、索引）。右键单击域并选择“更新域”，或按 F9。Alt+F9 可显示域代码。",
