 "Ledger Web Edition": "Ledger 网页版",
 "Ledger builds the report as a formatted summary of values; rebuild it after the source data changes.": "Ledger 将报表生成为带格式的数值汇总；源数据更改后需重新生成。",
 "Ledger cannot calculate a formula. Cell references in the formula refer to the formula's result, creating a circular reference.\\n\\nTo fix it, remove or change the reference, or turn on iterative calculation (Tools ▸ Options ▸ Calculation).": "Ledger 无法计算公式。公式中的单元格引用指向该公式的结果，形成了循环引用。\\n\\n请删除或更改该引用，或启用迭代计算（“工具 ▸ 选项 ▸ 计算”）。",
 "Ledger cannot determine which row in your list or selection contains column labels, which are required for this command.": "Ledger 无法确定列表或选区中哪一行包含此命令所需的列标签。",
 "Ledger cannot find any dependent cells.": "Ledger 找不到任何从属单元格。",
 "Ledger cannot find the data you're searching for.": "Ledger 找不到您要查找的数据。",
 "Ledger cannot read this picture.": "Ledger 无法读取此图片。",
 "Ledger did not find anything to print.": "Ledger 未找到可打印的内容。",
 "Ledger does not run macros. Workbooks with macros (.xlsm) open and save with their macros intact.": "Ledger 不运行宏。包含宏的工作簿 (.xlsm) 可打开和保存，其中的宏会原样保留。",
 "Ledger found an error in the formula you entered. Do you want to accept the correction proposed below?\\n\\n={0}\\n\\n• To accept the correction, click Yes.\\n• To close this message and correct the formula yourself, click No.": "Ledger 发现您输入的公式有错误。是否接受以下更正建议？\\n\\n={0}\\n\\n• 单击“是”接受更正。\\n• 单击“否”关闭此信息并自行更正公式。",
 "Ledger has completed its search and has made {0} replacement.": "Ledger 已完成搜索，共替换 {0} 处。",
 "Ledger has completed its search and has made {0} replacements.": "Ledger 已完成搜索，共替换 {0} 处。",
 "Ledger prints by creating a PDF that you can open and print on any printer.": "Ledger 通过创建 PDF 进行打印，您可以打开该 PDF 并使用任意打印机打印。",
 "Ledger reads and writes Office Open XML workbooks (.xlsx, macro-enabled .xlsm and templates), keeping formulas, styles, merged cells, comments, lists, conditional formats, validation, charts, pictures, defined names, page setup and macros. It also opens CSV and text files through the Text Import Wizard, opens password-protected workbooks and can save with a password (Save As ▸ Tools ▸ General Options). Binary .xls files must be converted to .xlsx first.": "Ledger 可读写 Office Open XML 工作簿（.xlsx、启用宏的 .xlsm 及模板），保留公式、样式、合并单元格、批注、列表、条件格式、数据验证、图表、图片、定义的名称、页面设置和宏。它还可通过文本导入向导打开 CSV 和文本文件，打开有密码保护的工作簿，并可使用密码保存（“另存为 ▸ 工具 ▸ 常规选项”）。二进制 .xls 文件须先转换为 .xlsx。",
 "Ledger shows one window per workbook. Use the Window menu to switch between open workbooks.": "Ledger 为每个工作簿显示一个窗口。使用“窗口”菜单可在打开的工作簿之间切换。",
