 "To format text: select the text, then choose the font button. To insert a page number, date, time, file path, filename, or tab name: position the insertion point in the edit box, then choose the appropriate button.": "设置文字格式：选择文字后单击字体按钮。插入页码、日期、时间、文件路径、文件名或工作表标签名：在编辑框中定位插入点，再单击相应按钮。",
 "To prevent possible loss of data, Ledger cannot shift nonblank cells off of the worksheet.": "为防止数据丢失，Ledger 不能将非空单元格移出工作表。",
 "To print, save these pages as a PDF and print the PDF.": "要打印，请将这些页面保存为 PDF，再打印该 PDF。",
 "To restrict editing instead, use Tools ▸ Protect Document.": "若要限制编辑，请使用“工具 ▸ 保护文档”。",
 "To show the result of the underlined expression, click Evaluate. The most recent result appears italicized.": "单击“求值”可显示带下划线表达式的结果。最近的结果以斜体显示。",
 "To write to this address, copy it and paste it into your e-mail program.": "要向此地址发送电子邮件，请复制该地址并粘贴到您的电子邮件程序中。",
