 "Toolbars": "工具栏",
 "Tools": "工具",
 "Tools ▸ Formula Auditing traces precedents and dependents with arrows, evaluates a formula step by step and shows a Watch Window. Ctrl+\` shows formulas instead of results. Error Checking walks through cells with errors.": "“工具 ▸ 公式审核”可用箭头追踪引用单元格和从属单元格，逐步对公式求值，并显示监视窗口。Ctrl+\` 可显示公式而非结果。“错误检查”会逐个检查有错误的单元格。",
 "Tools ▸ Goal Seek finds the input that makes a formula reach a target. Data ▸ Table builds one- and two-variable data tables. Tools ▸ Scenarios stores sets of input values to compare.": "“工具 ▸ 单变量求解”可找到使公式达到目标值的输入值。“数据 ▸ 模拟运算表”可建立单变量或双变量模拟运算表。“工具 ▸ 方案”可存储多组输入值以便比较。",
 "Tools ▸ Letters and Mailings ▸ Mail Merge opens a six-step wizard: choose letters, envelopes, labels or a directory; open a .csv, .txt or .docx data source or type a new list; insert the address block, greeting line and merge fields; preview each record; then merge to a new document or to a PDF.": "“工具 ▸ 信函与邮件 ▸ 邮件合并”打开六步向导：选择信函、信封、标签或目录；打开 .csv、.txt 或 .docx 数据源，或键入新列表；插入地址块、问候语和合并域；预览各条记录；最后合并到新文档或 PDF。",
 "Tools ▸ Protection ▸ Protect Sheet locks every cell whose Locked box (Format ▸ Cells ▸ Protection) is checked; choose what users may still do, and set an optional password. Protect Workbook locks the sheet structure.": "“工具 ▸ 保护 ▸ 保护工作表”会锁定所有勾选了“锁定”（“格式 ▸ 单元格 ▸ 保护”）的单元格；您可指定用户仍能执行的操作，并设置可选密码。“保护工作簿”会锁定工作表结构。",
 "Tools ▸ Track Changes (Ctrl+Shift+E) marks insertions, deletions and formatting changes. The Reviewing toolbar accepts or rejects changes and moves between them. Insert ▸ Comment adds a comment balloon in Print Layout. Tools ▸ Compare and Merge Documents marks the differences with another .docx.": "“工具 ▸ 修订”(Ctrl+Shift+E) 标记插入、删除和格式更改。“审阅”工具栏可接受、拒绝修订并在修订之间移动。“插入 ▸ 批注”可在页面视图中添加批注框。“工具 ▸ 比较并合并文档”可标记与另一份 .docx 的差异。",
