 "VibeOffice.work keeps Recent Files and unsaved changes in this browser, and Safari's Lockdown Mode turns that off.\\n\\nTo allow it for this site only: tap aA in the address bar, tap Website Settings, and turn off Lockdown Mode. Safari reloads the page.": "VibeOffice.work 在此浏览器中保留最近使用的文件和未保存的更改，Safari 的锁定模式会禁用此功能。\\n\\n仅对此网站允许此功能：轻点地址栏中的 aA，轻点“网站设置”，然后关闭锁定模式。Safari 将重新加载页面。",
 "VibeOffice.work: Quire (documents), Ledger (spreadsheets) and Lectern (presentations).": "VibeOffice.work：Quire（文档）、Ledger（电子表格）和 Lectern（演示文稿）。",
