 "is a logical value: to find the closest match in the first column (sorted in ascending order) = TRUE or omitted; find an exact match = FALSE.": "逻辑值：在首列（按升序排列）中查找近似匹配为 TRUE 或省略；查找精确匹配为 FALSE。",
