 "is the condition or criteria in the form of a number, expression, or text that defines which cells will be added.": "以数字、表达式或文本形式给出的条件，用于确定要相加的单元格。",
 "is the future value, or a cash balance you want to attain after the last payment is made.": "终值，即最后一次付款后希望达到的现金余额。",
