 "A comment thread you edited will be saved as an ordinary note. Excel will show it as a note, not as a conversation.": "您編輯的註解對話將儲存為普通備註。Excel 會將其顯示為備註，而非對話。",
 "A formula or function contains invalid numeric values.": "公式或函數包含無效的數值。",
 "A free office suite that runs in your browser: a word processor, a spreadsheet and a presentation editor for .docx, .xlsx and .pptx files.": "在瀏覽器中執行的免費辦公室套件，提供文書處理器、試算表和簡報編輯器，可處理 .docx、.xlsx 和 .pptx 檔案。",
 "A labelled box for each item, holding its sub-items.": "每個項目各佔一個帶標籤的方框，子項目置於其中。",
 "A list cannot overlap another list.": "清單不能與其他清單重疊。",
 "A newer version of VibeOffice is available. This one is {0}.": "VibeOffice 有新版本可用。目前版本為 {0}。",
 "A pasted slicer or timeline will be saved as a plain shape and won't filter anything, because its table or pivot table isn't in this workbook.": "貼上的切片器或時間線將儲存為普通形狀，無法篩選資料，因為其所屬的表或樞紐分析表不在此活頁簿中。",
 "A picture fill on a shape of this IntelliArt is saved as the diagram's colour.": "此 IntelliArt 中形狀的圖片填滿將儲存為圖表的色彩。",
 "A picture is not in the .md file and shows as a box. Open a .zip holding the file and its pictures to see them.": "圖片不在 .md 檔案中，因此顯示為方框。請開啟包含該檔案及其圖片的 .zip 檔案以查看圖片。",
 "A presentation editor that runs entirely in your browser. Presentations are read and written as Office Open XML (.pptx, .pptm); nothing is uploaded.": "完全在瀏覽器中執行的簡報編輯器。支援讀寫 Office Open XML（.pptx、.pptm）簡報；不會上傳任何內容。",
 "A reference to an IntelliArt drawing cache missing from the original file was removed; its data and layout are retained.": "原檔案中缺失的 IntelliArt 繪圖快取參照已移除；其資料和版面配置仍予以保留。",
 "A sheet name cannot begin or end with an apostrophe.": "工作表名稱不能以單引號開頭或結尾。",
 "A sheet name cannot contain any of these characters:  : \\\\ / ? * [ ]": "工作表名稱不能包含以下字元：: \\\\ / ? * [ ]",
