 "Choose AutoShapes on the Drawing toolbar, then drag on the slide. Hold Shift for perfect squares, circles and 15° angles; hold Ctrl to draw from the center. Yellow diamonds adjust a shape's proportions; the green dot rotates.": "在「繪圖」工具列中選取「快取圖案」，然後在投影片上拖曳。按住 Shift 可繪製正方形、正圓或以 15° 為單位的角度；按住 Ctrl 可從中心繪製。黃色菱形用於調整形狀比例，綠色圓點用於旋轉。",
