 "Data source: {0}. Click a column heading to sort; clear a check box to leave a recipient out.": "資料來源：{0}。按一下欄標題可排序；清除核取方塊可排除相應收件人。",
 "Data ▸ List ▸ Create List (Ctrl+L) turns a range into a list with a header row, AutoFilter and an optional Total Row. Formulas can refer to it by name: =SUM(Table1[Amount]).": "「資料 ▸ 清單 ▸ 建立清單」(Ctrl+L) 可將範圍轉換為包含標題列、自動篩選和可選彙總列的清單。公式可以通過名稱參照清單，例如：=SUM(Table1[Amount])。",
 "Data ▸ Sort sorts by up to three keys, ascending or descending, with or without a header row; the Sort buttons sort by the active column. Data ▸ Filter ▸ AutoFilter adds drop-down arrows to the header row: pick a value, (Top 10...), (Custom...), (Blanks) or (NonBlanks). Advanced Filter uses a criteria range and can copy unique records elsewhere. Data ▸ Subtotals inserts SUBTOTAL rows at each change in a column and outlines the list.": "「資料 ▸ 排序」支援最多三個關鍵字，可遞增或遞減排列，也可指定有無標題列；排序按鈕則按作用中欄排序。「資料 ▸ 篩選 ▸ 自動篩選」會在標題列新增下拉箭頭，可選取某個值、「前 10 個...」、「自訂...」、「空白」或「非空白」。進階篩選使用條件範圍，並可將不重複的記錄複製到其他位置。「資料 ▸ 小計」會在指定欄內容變化處插入 SUBTOTAL 彙總列，並建立分級顯示。",
