 "Drag the fill handle (the square at the bottom-right of the selection) to copy cells or extend a series: 1, 2 → 3, 4…; Mon → Tue; Jan → Feb; Q1 → Q2; dates by day, weekday, month or year. Double-click the handle to fill down beside your data. Edit ▸ Fill ▸ Series gives full control; Ctrl+D and Ctrl+R fill down and right.": "拖曳填滿柄（選取範圍右下角的小方塊）可複製儲存格或擴展數列：1、2 → 3、4…；Mon → Tue；Jan → Feb；Q1 → Q2；日期可按日、工作日、月或年遞增。按兩下填滿柄可沿相鄰資料向下填滿。「編輯 ▸ 填滿 ▸ 數列」提供完整設定；Ctrl+D 和 Ctrl+R 分別向下和向右填滿。",
