 "Font names are used solely to identify the fonts specified in documents and to maintain interoperability with Office Open XML files and the applications that create them; such names may be trademarks of their respective owners. VibeOffice renders text with the fonts installed on your computer. Where a specified font is not installed, VibeOffice substitutes an open-source font supplied with it or another font available on your computer, and the document may therefore appear differently than in other applications. VibeOffice does not include or distribute any commercial font software.": "字型名稱僅用於識別文件中指定的字型，並維持與 Office Open XML 檔案及建立這些檔案的應用程式之間的互通性；這些名稱可能是各自擁有者的商標。VibeOffice 使用您電腦上安裝的字型顯示文字。如果指定的字型未安裝，VibeOffice 會使用隨軟體提供的開放原始碼字型或您電腦上其他可用的字型來替代，因此文件的顯示效果可能與其他應用程式有所不同。VibeOffice 不包含或散布任何商用字型軟體。",
