 "Insert the contents of a .docx, .txt or .htm file, or a picture.": "插入 .docx、.txt 或 .htm 檔案的內容，或插入圖片。",
 "Insert the date / time": "插入日期/時間",
 "Insert worksheet": "插入工作表",
 "Insert ▸ Break adds page, column and section breaks. Each section can have its own margins, orientation, paper size, columns and headers. File ▸ Page Setup sets margins, paper, layout (different first page, odd and even, vertical alignment, line numbers) for the current section or the whole document.": "「插入 ▸ 分隔符號」可新增分頁符號、分欄符號和分節符號。每節可設定獨立的邊界、方向、紙張大小、分欄和頁首。「檔案 ▸ 版面設定」可為目前節或整個文件設定邊界、紙張及版面配置（首頁不同、奇偶頁不同、垂直對齊、行號）。",
 "Insert ▸ Chart (F11) opens the Chart Wizard: column, bar, line, pie, XY scatter, area and doughnut charts, embedded in the sheet or on their own chart sheet. Charts follow their data as it changes. Insert ▸ Picture adds images and AutoShapes; drag to move, drag a handle to resize, double-click to format.": "「插入 ▸ 圖表」(F11) 可開啟圖表精靈，建立直條圖、橫條圖、折線圖、圓餅圖、XY 散佈圖、面積圖和圓環圖，並將其嵌入工作表或置於獨立圖表工作表中。圖表會隨資料更改而更新。「插入 ▸ 圖片」可新增圖片和快取圖案；拖曳可移動，拖曳控點可調整大小，按兩下可設定格式。",
 "Insert ▸ Picture ▸ From File, Clip Art, AutoShapes, LettersArt or Chart. Choose a wrapping style from Format ▸ Picture ▸ Layout or the Text Wrapping button. Drag floating objects to move them; drag handles to resize; the green handle rotates shapes.": "通過「插入 ▸ 圖片」選取「來自檔案」、「美工圖案」、「快取圖案」、「LettersArt」或「圖表」。在「格式 ▸ 圖片 ▸ 版面配置」或「文繞圖」按鈕中選取環繞方式。拖曳浮動物件可移動，拖曳控點可調整大小，綠色控點可旋轉形狀。",
 "Insert ▸ Reference": "插入 ▸ 參照",
 "Insert ▸ Reference ▸ Footnote (Ctrl+Alt+F footnote, Ctrl+Alt+D endnote), Caption, Cross-reference and Index and Tables (table of contents, figures, index). Right-click a field and choose Update Field, or press F9. Alt+F9 shows field codes.": "「插入 ▸ 參照」提供「註腳」（Ctrl+Alt+F 為註腳，Ctrl+Alt+D 為章節附註）、「標號」、「交叉參照」和「索引和目錄」（目錄、圖表目錄、索引）。按滑鼠右鍵欄位並選取「更新欄位」，或按 F9。Alt+F9 可顯示欄位代碼。",
