 "Ledger": "Ledger",
 "Ledger &Help": "Ledger 說明(&H)",
 "Ledger 2003": "Ledger 2003",
 "Ledger 2003 Web Edition": "Ledger 2003 網頁版",
 "Ledger 2003 spreadsheet": "Ledger 2003 試算表",
 "Ledger Help": "Ledger 說明",
 "Ledger PDF Writer": "Ledger PDF 生成器",
 "Ledger User": "Ledger 使用者",
 "Ledger Web Edition": "Ledger 網頁版",
 "Ledger builds the report as a formatted summary of values; rebuild it after the source data changes.": "Ledger 將報表生成為帶格式的數值彙總；來源資料更改後需重新生成。",
 "Ledger cannot calculate a formula. Cell references in the formula refer to the formula's result, creating a circular reference.\\n\\nTo fix it, remove or change the reference, or turn on iterative calculation (Tools ▸ Options ▸ Calculation).": "Ledger 無法計算公式。公式中的儲存格參照指向該公式的結果，形成了循環參照。\\n\\n請刪除或更改該參照，或啟用反覆運算計算（「工具 ▸ 選項 ▸ 計算」）。",
 "Ledger cannot determine which row in your list or selection contains column labels, which are required for this command.": "Ledger 無法確定清單或選取範圍中哪一列包含此命令所需的欄標籤。",
 "Ledger cannot find any dependent cells.": "Ledger 找不到任何從屬儲存格。",
 "Ledger cannot find the data you're searching for.": "Ledger 找不到您要尋找的資料。",
 "Ledger cannot read this picture.": "Ledger 無法讀取此圖片。",
 "Ledger did not find anything to print.": "Ledger 未找到可列印的內容。",
 "Ledger does not run macros. Workbooks with macros (.xlsm) open and save with their macros intact.": "Ledger 不執行巨集。包含巨集的活頁簿 (.xlsm) 可開啟和儲存，其中的巨集會原樣保留。",
 "Ledger found an error in the formula you entered. Do you want to accept the correction proposed below?\\n\\n={0}\\n\\n• To accept the correction, click Yes.\\n• To close this message and correct the formula yourself, click No.": "Ledger 發現您輸入的公式有錯誤。是否接受以下更正建議？\\n\\n={0}\\n\\n• 按一下「是」接受更正。\\n• 按一下「否」關閉此訊息並自行更正公式。",
 "Ledger has completed its search and has made {0} replacement.": "Ledger 已完成搜尋，共取代 {0} 處。",
 "Ledger has completed its search and has made {0} replacements.": "Ledger 已完成搜尋，共取代 {0} 處。",
 "Ledger prints by creating a PDF that you can open and print on any printer.": "Ledger 通過建立 PDF 進行列印，您可以開啟該 PDF 並使用任意列印機列印。",
 "Ledger reads and writes Office Open XML workbooks (.xlsx, macro-enabled .xlsm and templates), keeping formulas, styles, merged cells, comments, lists, conditional formats, validation, charts, pictures, defined names, page setup and macros. It also opens CSV and text files through the Text Import Wizard, opens password-protected workbooks and can save with a password (Save As ▸ Tools ▸ General Options). Binary .xls files must be converted to .xlsx first.": "Ledger 可讀寫 Office Open XML 活頁簿（.xlsx、啟用巨集的 .xlsm 及範本），保留公式、樣式、合併儲存格、註解、清單、條件式格式、資料驗證、圖表、圖片、定義的名稱、版面設定和巨集。它還可通過文字匯入精靈開啟 CSV 和文字檔案，開啟有密碼保護的活頁簿，並可使用密碼儲存（「另存新檔 ▸ 工具 ▸ 一般選項」）。二進位 .xls 檔案須先轉換為 .xlsx。",
 "Ledger shows one window per workbook. Use the Window menu to switch between open workbooks.": "Ledger 為每個活頁簿顯示一個視窗。使用「視窗」功能表可在開啟的活頁簿之間切換。",
