 "Normal shows the text in one continuous column with page breaks as dotted lines. Web Layout wraps text to the window. Print Layout shows the pages exactly as they print, with headers, footers and balloons. Outline shows heading levels to promote, demote and rearrange. Reading Layout shows two pages side by side for reading. Print Preview (Ctrl+F2) shows one or several whole pages.": "標準模式將文字顯示為連續的一欄，並以虛線表示分頁符號。Web 版面配置依視窗寬度換行。整頁模式依實際列印效果顯示頁面，包括頁首、頁尾和註解方塊。大綱模式顯示標題階層，方便升階、降階和重新排列。閱讀版面配置並排顯示兩頁以便閱讀。列印預覽 (Ctrl+F2) 顯示一頁或多頁的完整頁面。",
