 "Returns a complex number raised to an integer power.": "傳回複數的整數次冪。",
 "Returns a formula as a string.": "以字串形式傳回公式。",
 "Returns a key performance indicator (KPI) property and displays the KPI name in the cell.": "傳回關鍵績效指標 (KPI) 的屬性，並在儲存格中顯示 KPI 名稱。",
 "Returns a member or tuple from the cube.": "傳回多維資料集中的成員或元組。",
 "Returns a normalized value from a distribution characterized by a mean and standard deviation.": "根據分配的平均值和標準差傳回標準化值。",
 "Returns a number corresponding to an error value.": "傳回與錯誤值對應的數字。",
 "Returns a number from 1 to 7 identifying the day of the week of a date.": "傳回 1 至 7 的數字，表示日期是一週中的第幾天。",
 "Returns a number rounded to the desired multiple.": "傳回捨入到指定倍數的數字。",
 "Returns a number shifted left by shift_amount bits.": "傳回將數字向左移動 shift_amount 位的結果。",
 "Returns a number shifted right by shift_amount bits.": "傳回將數字向右移動 shift_amount 位的結果。",
 "Returns a numeric code for the first character in a text string, in the character set used by your computer.": "按電腦使用的字元集，傳回文字字串首字元的數字代碼。",
 "Returns a random number between the numbers you specify.": "傳回指定兩個數字之間的隨機數。",
 "Returns a random number greater than or equal to 0 and less than 1, evenly distributed (changes on recalculation).": "傳回大於等於 0 且小於 1 的均勻分佈隨機數，重新計算時會更改。",
 "Returns a reference to a range that is a given number of rows and columns from a given reference.": "傳回相對於給定參照偏移指定列數和欄數的範圍參照。",
 "Returns a sequence of numbers.": "傳回數字數列。",
 "Returns a subtotal in a list or database.": "傳回清單或資料庫中的小計。",
 "Returns a text representation of an array.": "傳回陣列的文字表示。",
 "Returns a value or reference of the cell at the intersection of a particular row and column, in a given range.": "傳回給定範圍中指定列欄交叉處儲存格的值或參照。",
 "Returns a vertical array of the most frequently occurring, or repetitive, values in an array or range of data.": "以垂直陣列形式傳回陣列或資料範圍中出現頻率最高的值。",
 "Returns an aggregate in a list or database, optionally ignoring hidden rows and error values.": "傳回清單或資料庫中的彙總值，可選取忽略隱藏列和錯誤值。",
 "Returns an array formed by mapping each value in the array(s) to a new value by applying a LAMBDA.": "將 LAMBDA 套用於陣列中的每個值，傳回映射後的新值組成的陣列。",
 "Returns an array of a specified row and column size, by applying a LAMBDA.": "通過套用 LAMBDA，傳回指定列數和欄數的陣列。",
 "Returns an array of random numbers.": "傳回隨機數陣列。",
 "Returns an equivalent interest rate for the growth of an investment.": "傳回投資增長的等效利率。",
 "Returns bytes from the middle of a text string, given a starting position and length.": "根據指定的起始位置和長度，從文字字串中間傳回位元組。",
 "Returns covariance, the average of the products of deviations for each data point pair in two data sets.": "傳回共變異數，即兩個資料集中每對資料點的離差乘積的平均值。",
 "Returns e raised to the power of a given number.": "傳回 e 的指定次冪。",
 "Returns information about the current operating environment.": "傳回目前操作環境的資訊。",
 "Returns information about the formatting, location, or contents of the first cell, according to the sheet's reading order, in a reference.": "按工作表的閱讀順序，傳回參照中第一個儲存格的格式、位置或內容資訊。",
 "Returns numbers in a linear trend matching known data points, using the least squares method.": "使用最小平方法，傳回擬合已知資料點的線性趨勢值。",
 "Returns numbers in an exponential growth trend matching known data points.": "傳回擬合已知資料點的指數增長趨勢值。",
 "Returns population covariance, the average of the products of deviations for each data point pair in two data sets.": "傳回母體共變異數，即兩個資料集中每對資料點的離差乘積的平均值。",
 "Returns rows or columns from the start or end of an array.": "傳回陣列開頭或末尾的指定列或欄。",
 "Returns specific data from the XML content by using the specified XPath.": "使用指定的 XPath，從 XML 內容中傳回特定資料。",
 "Returns statistics that describe a linear trend matching known data points, by fitting a straight line using the least squares method.": "使用最小平方法配適直線，傳回描述已知資料點線性趨勢的統計值。",
 "Returns statistics that describe an exponential curve matching known data points.": "傳回描述擬合已知資料點的指數曲線的統計值。",
 "Returns text that occurs after a given character or string.": "傳回指定字元或字串之後的文字。",
 "Returns text that occurs before a given character or string.": "傳回指定字元或字串之前的文字。",
 "Returns the (left-tailed) F probability distribution (degree of diversity) for two data sets.": "傳回兩個資料集的左尾 F 機率分配（差異程度）。",
 "Returns the (right-tailed) F probability distribution (degree of diversity) for two data sets.": "傳回兩個資料集的右尾 F 機率分配（差異程度）。",
 "Returns the Bessel function Jn(x).": "傳回貝塞爾函數 Jn(x)。",
 "Returns the Bessel function Yn(x).": "傳回貝塞爾函數 Yn(x)。",
 "Returns the F probability distribution (degree of diversity) for two data sets.": "傳回兩個資料集的 F 機率分配（差異程度）。",
 "Returns the Fisher transformation.": "傳回 Fisher 變換值。",
 "Returns the Gamma function value.": "傳回 Gamma 函數值。",
 "Returns the ISO week number in the year for a given date.": "傳回指定日期所在年份中的 ISO 週數。",
 "Returns the Macauley modified duration for a security with an assumed par value of $100.": "傳回假設面值為 $100 的證券的修正麥考利久期。",
 "Returns the Pearson product moment correlation coefficient, r.": "傳回 Pearson 積矩相關係數 r。",
 "Returns the Poisson distribution.": "傳回 Poisson 分配。",
 "Returns the Student's t-distribution.": "傳回 Student t 分配。",
 "Returns the Unicode character referenced by the given numeric value.": "傳回指定數值對應的 Unicode 字元。",
 "Returns the Weibull distribution.": "傳回 Weibull 分配。",
