 "Returns the prorated linear depreciation of an asset for each accounting period, using a depreciation coefficient.": "使用折舊係數，傳回資產在各會計期間按比例分攤的線性折舊額。",
 "Returns the prorated linear depreciation of an asset for each accounting period.": "傳回資產在各會計期間按比例分攤的線性折舊額。",
 "Returns the quartile of a data set, based on percentile values from 0..1, exclusive.": "根據 0 至 1 之間（不包括端點）的百分位數，傳回資料集的四分位數。",
 "Returns the quartile of a data set, based on percentile values from 0..1, inclusive.": "根據 0 至 1 之間（包括端點）的百分位數，傳回資料集的四分位數。",
 "Returns the quartile of a data set.": "傳回資料集的四分位數。",
