 "Returns the rank of a number in a list of numbers: its size relative to other values in the list.": "傳回數字在數值清單中的排名，即其大小相對於其他數值的位置。",
 "Returns the rank of a number in a list of numbers; if more than one value has the same rank, the average rank is returned.": "傳回數字在數值清單中的排名；若多個值排名相同，則傳回平均排名。",
 "Returns the rank of a number in a list of numbers; if more than one value has the same rank, the top rank of that set of values is returned.": "傳回數字在數值清單中的排名；若多個值排名相同，則傳回這些值的最高排名。",
 "Returns the rank of a value in a data set as a percentage of the data set (0..1, exclusive).": "以百分比形式傳回某個值在資料集中的排名，範圍為 0 至 1，不包括端點。",
 "Returns the rank of a value in a data set as a percentage of the data set (0..1, inclusive).": "以百分比形式傳回某個值在資料集中的排名，範圍為 0 至 1，包括端點。",
 "Returns the rank of a value in a data set as a percentage of the data set.": "以百分比形式傳回某個值在資料集中的排名。",
 "Returns the real coefficient of a complex number.": "傳回複數的實部係數。",
 "Returns the reference specified by a text string.": "傳回文字字串指定的參照。",
 "Returns the relative position of an item in an array that matches a specified value in a specified order.": "依指定順序比對指定值，傳回相符項目在陣列中的相對位置。",
 "Returns the remainder after a number is divided by a divisor.": "傳回數字除以除數後的餘數。",
 "Returns the result of a number raised to a power.": "傳回數字的指定次冪。",
 "Returns the result of an F-test, the two-tailed probability that the variances in Array1 and Array2 are not significantly different.": "傳回 F 檢定結果，即 Array1 和 Array2 的變異數沒有顯著差異的雙尾機率。",
 "Returns the right-tailed Student's t-distribution.": "傳回右尾 Student t 分配。",
 "Returns the right-tailed probability of the chi-squared distribution.": "傳回卡方分配的右尾機率。",
 "Returns the row number of a reference.": "傳回參照的列號。",
 "Returns the sample covariance, the average of the products of deviations for each data point pair in two data sets.": "傳回樣本共變異數，即兩個資料集中每對資料點的離差乘積的平均值。",
 "Returns the secant of a complex number.": "傳回複數的正割值。",
 "Returns the secant of an angle.": "傳回角度的正割值。",
 "Returns the second, a number from 0 to 59.": "傳回秒數，數值為 0 至 59。",
 "Returns the serial number of the date before or after a specified number of workdays with custom weekend parameters.": "使用自訂週末參數，傳回指定工作日數之前或之後的日期序號。",
 "Returns the serial number of the date before or after a specified number of workdays.": "傳回指定工作日數之前或之後的日期序號。",
 "Returns the serial number of the date that is the indicated number of months before or after the start date.": "傳回起始日期之前或之後指定月數的日期序號。",
 "Returns the serial number of the last day of the month before or after a specified number of months.": "傳回指定月數之前或之後月份的最後一天的日期序號。",
 "Returns the sheet number of the referenced sheet.": "傳回所參照工作表的編號。",
 "Returns the sign of a number: 1 if the number is positive, zero if the number is zero, or -1 if the number is negative.": "傳回數字的符號：正數傳回 1，零傳回 0，負數傳回 -1。",
