 "Returns the skewness of a distribution based on a population.": "傳回基於母體的分配偏度。",
 "Returns the skewness of a distribution: a characterization of the degree of asymmetry of a distribution around its mean.": "傳回分配的偏度，用於描述分配圍繞其平均值的不對稱程度。",
 "Returns the slope of the linear regression line through the given data points.": "傳回通過給定資料點的線性迴歸直線的斜率。",
 "Returns the smallest number in a set of values. Ignores logical values and text.": "傳回一組值中的最小數字，忽略邏輯值和文字。",
 "Returns the smallest number in the field (column) of records in the database that match the conditions you specify.": "傳回資料庫中符合指定條件的記錄在指定欄位（欄）中的最小數字。",
 "Returns the smallest value for which the cumulative binomial distribution is greater than or equal to a criterion value.": "傳回使累積二項分配大於等於指定閾值的最小值。",
 "Returns the smallest value in a set of values. Does not ignore logical values and text.": "傳回一組值中的最小值，不忽略邏輯值和文字。",
