 "Returns the standard normal cumulative distribution (has a mean of zero and a standard deviation of one).": "傳回標準常態累積分配（平均值為 0，標準差為 1）。",
 "Returns the standard normal distribution (has a mean of zero and a standard deviation of one).": "傳回標準常態分配（平均值為 0，標準差為 1）。",
 "Returns the starting position of one text string within another text string. FIND is case-sensitive.": "傳回一個文字字串在另一個文字字串中的起始位置。FIND 區分大小寫。",
