 "Returns the sum of the products of corresponding ranges or arrays.": "傳回對應範圍或陣列中各元素乘積的總和。",
 "Returns the sum of the squares of the arguments. The arguments can be numbers, arrays, names or references to cells that contain numbers.": "傳回引數的平方和。引數可以是數字、陣列、名稱或包含數字的儲存格參照。",
 "Returns the sum total of the sums of squares of numbers in two corresponding ranges or arrays.": "傳回兩個對應範圍或陣列中各對數值的平方和的總和。",
