 "Returns the unique values from a range or array.": "傳回範圍或陣列中的唯一值。",
 "Returns the unit matrix for the specified dimension.": "傳回指定維度的單位矩陣。",
 "Returns the value of Pi, 3.14159265358979, accurate to 15 digits.": "傳回 Pi 的值 3.14159265358979，精確到 15 位數字。",
