 "This screen lets you select each column and set the Data Format. 'General' converts numeric values to numbers, date values to dates, and all remaining values to text.": "在此步驟中，可選取各欄並設定資料格式。「一般」會將數值轉換為數字、日期值轉換為日期，其餘值轉換為文字。",
 "This screen lets you set field widths (column breaks). Lines with arrows signify a column break. To CREATE a break line, click at the desired position. To DELETE a break line, click on it.": "在此步驟中，可設定欄位寬度（分欄線）。帶箭頭的線表示欄邊界。按一下所需位置可建立分欄線；按一下已有分欄線可將其刪除。",
 "This screen lets you set the delimiters your data contains. You can see how your text is affected in the preview below.": "在此步驟中，可設定資料使用的分隔符號。下方預覽會顯示設定對文字的影響。",
