 "To format text: select the text, then choose the font button. To insert a page number, date, time, file path, filename, or tab name: position the insertion point in the edit box, then choose the appropriate button.": "設定文字格式：選取文字後按一下字型按鈕。插入頁碼、日期、時間、檔案路徑、檔名或工作表標籤名：在編輯框中定位插入點，再按一下相應按鈕。",
