 "Toolbars": "工具列",
 "Tools": "工具",
 "Tools ▸ Formula Auditing traces precedents and dependents with arrows, evaluates a formula step by step and shows a Watch Window. Ctrl+\` shows formulas instead of results. Error Checking walks through cells with errors.": "「工具 ▸ 公式稽核」可用箭頭追蹤參照儲存格和從屬儲存格，逐步對公式求值，並顯示監視視窗。Ctrl+\` 可顯示公式而非結果。「錯誤檢查」會逐個檢查有錯誤的儲存格。",
 "Tools ▸ Goal Seek finds the input that makes a formula reach a target. Data ▸ Table builds one- and two-variable data tables. Tools ▸ Scenarios stores sets of input values to compare.": "「工具 ▸ 單變量求解」可找到使公式達到目標值的輸入值。「資料 ▸ 模擬運算表」可建立單變量或雙變量模擬運算表。「工具 ▸ 方案」可存儲多組輸入值以便比較。",
 "Tools ▸ Letters and Mailings ▸ Mail Merge opens a six-step wizard: choose letters, envelopes, labels or a directory; open a .csv, .txt or .docx data source or type a new list; insert the address block, greeting line and merge fields; preview each record; then merge to a new document or to a PDF.": "「工具 ▸ 信函與郵件 ▸ 合併列印」開啟六步精靈：選取信函、信封、標籤或目錄；開啟 .csv、.txt 或 .docx 資料來源，或輸入新清單；插入地址區塊、問候語和合併欄位；預覽各條記錄；最後合併到新文件或 PDF。",
 "Tools ▸ Protection ▸ Protect Sheet locks every cell whose Locked box (Format ▸ Cells ▸ Protection) is checked; choose what users may still do, and set an optional password. Protect Workbook locks the sheet structure.": "「工具 ▸ 保護 ▸ 保護工作表」會鎖定所有勾選了「鎖定」（「格式 ▸ 儲存格 ▸ 保護」）的儲存格；您可指定使用者仍能執行的操作，並設定可選密碼。「保護活頁簿」會鎖定工作表結構。",
 "Tools ▸ Track Changes (Ctrl+Shift+E) marks insertions, deletions and formatting changes. The Reviewing toolbar accepts or rejects changes and moves between them. Insert ▸ Comment adds a comment balloon in Print Layout. Tools ▸ Compare and Merge Documents marks the differences with another .docx.": "「工具 ▸ 修訂」(Ctrl+Shift+E) 標記插入、刪除和格式更改。「校閱」工具列可接受、拒絕修訂並在修訂之間移動。「插入 ▸ 註解」可在整頁模式中新增註解框。「工具 ▸ 比較併合併文件」可標記與另一份 .docx 的差異。",
