 "VibeOffice.work keeps Recent Files and unsaved changes in this browser, and Safari's Lockdown Mode turns that off.\\n\\nTo allow it for this site only: tap aA in the address bar, tap Website Settings, and turn off Lockdown Mode. Safari reloads the page.": "VibeOffice.work 在此瀏覽器中保留最近使用的檔案和未儲存的更改，Safari 的鎖定模式會禁用此功能。\\n\\n僅對此網站允許此功能：輕點地址欄中的 aA，輕點「網站設定」，然後關閉鎖定模式。Safari 將重新載入頁面。",
